Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:32:56 +0000
Subject: feat(demo): add a Compose canvas state demo for save/restore

Five cases draw inside withTransform/clipRect and again after the block, each
with a caption stating the correct render: dash after a transform, dash set
inside the block, line cap after clipRect, dashed then solid rectangle, and
font plus text alignment after a transform. The iOS, OHOS and web canvases
roll this state back on restore while Android keeps it, so the page shows
whether a renderer and the Compose canvas agree on every platform.

Listed in the Compose sample index as CanvasState.

Fork-Patch: compose-canvas-state-demo
Upstream-Status: pending
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

